  "notes": {
    "c0004.md": "# Roland Achebe\n\nSix ninety minute sessions, paid in full ninety five days ago. Three delivered.\nSession four has been booked three times and moved twice, both times inside\ntwenty four hours.\n\n- The package has no expiry and no cancellation term. Add both to the next one.\n- He asked for a written 360 summary that was never in the scope. Two hours so\n  far, none of it invoiced.\n- Do not offer the four session extension after session six. Offer it at five,\n  while there is still something to finish.\n",
    "p0005.md": "# Group cohort, autumn\n\nSix seats. Two self funded, four sponsored by Cordell. Three hours a session,\nsix people in the room, one of him.\n\nThe cohort is the only thing in the practice that does not scale with his\ncalendar. One session serves six clients. An individual session serves one.\n\nWhat it costs so far: five hours delivered, seven hours building material and\nwriting follow ups. The build cost is one time. The follow up cost is not, and\nat six seats it is three hours after every session.\n\nDecide before the spring cohort: cap the written follow ups at one paragraph\neach, or price them in at the seat level.\n"
  }
